abstract: >-
  Research record and Lean 4 formalization for the resolution of Erdős
  Problem 872: the divisor-antichain game on {2,...,n} has guaranteed
  length L(n) = o(n). Includes the full manuscript, 179 rounds of research
  dispatches, audits, and refutations, and the Lean 4 project in which
  Erdos872.main is kernel-checked from a single problem-specific analytic
  axiom (A3_exceptional_set_estimate, Lemma 2.3 of the manuscript).
